	(text "Features\n-------\n12V -> 5V Buck\nINA226 Current Sensor (5V bus)\nINA226 Current Sensor (3V3 bus, if not measured\ninternally)\nDS18b20 Temperature Sensor Header (SSD)\nDS18b20 Temperature Sensor Header (Enclosure)\nPoE (???)\nIR LED Power (possible via 5V USB-C?)\nIR LED FET\nINA226 Current Sensor (IR LED out)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
