	)
	(text "TODO\n-----\n- What is CC1, CC2? --> config channels for power negotiation\n- How much 5V power can USB-C deliver; support IR LEDs?\n- What can USB2 (USB-C) be used for?\n- Max power for PoE, enough for motor?\n- Is PoE supported? See CM5_GPIO\n- Power for solenoid, motor? Boost to 12V?\n- Port for ESP32 hardware controller interface?"
